  <div class="container">
    <h1>20 Days Silk Road: Uzbekistan, Kyrgyzstan & China</h1>
    <div class="route">📍 Tashkent &#8594; Samarkand &#8594; Bukhara &#8594; Bishkek &#8594; Issyk-Kul &#8594; Kashgar</div>
